{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602430","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1360243001:1":{"text":"아아, 멀린이 뭘 하든 이상하지 않지만, 반신까지 끌어들여서 축제를 만들다니. 참 대단하네요.","source_cn":"哎呀呀，虽然梅林这家伙干什么都很正常，但直接创造一个有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A85E77EB124BEF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1360243002:1":{"text":"하지만 이번 축제에서 제일 큰 공을 세운 건 저 아닐까요?!","source_cn":"只不过，这次的节日至少有一多半的功劳应该归我吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE452F708782F0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360243003:1":{"text":"그쵸? 당연히 이 몸이죠! 그러니까 저에게도 이름을 붙일 권리가 있다고요? 적어도 축제 이름에 베릴 이라는 이름은 있어야 해요!","source_cn":"对吧对吧，明明应该是我！我也应该有冠名权！这个节日有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0390080822B38C11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360243004:1":{"text":"아니에요.... 다시 생각하니까 좀 별로네요.","source_cn":"……啊，算了，有点恶心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86AC8E31CB84F666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360243005:1":{"text":"뭐, 너그러운 제가 인간의 불공평함을 받아들이는 것으로 하죠!","source_cn":"算了，宽宏大量的我就这样面对人类的不公平吧，","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBF2CA65359A4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360243006:1":{"text":"하지만 어쨌든 저도 한 몫 거들기는 했으니...","source_cn":"不过嘛，无论如何，我也算是尽心尽力了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBDC646E6DA2A916","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360243007:1":{"text":"인간들이 좋다고 떠드는 저 소리가 여러분들께는 지독한 소음처럼 들리지 않나요?","source_cn":"在诸位的耳中，人类认为美妙的东西多半犹如嘈杂刺耳的噪音...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C917CBC1E26C6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360243008:1":{"text":"하지만 반대로, 정말 소음이라면 여러분들은 그게 감미롭게 들리실까요?","source_cn":"但是反过来说，如果真的是噪音，诸位能否欣赏呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6D6F47BB4FA2811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1360243009:1":{"text":"아하하하하하하! 모두가 깊은 꿈을 꾸는 동안 제가 건넨 인사라고 생각해 달라고요!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，就当成我在诸位做着深沉美梦时的一点小小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5DA1B338BE6AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360243010:1":{"text":"여러분들과 다르게 저는 아주 예의바르고 인간적이니까요!","source_cn":"与你们不同，我可是非——常非常有礼貌，非常人性化的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B30DB9E33EF49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360243011:1":{"text":"그렇다면 이 소리에 깨서 분노에 차서 이를 갈지, 아니면 저의 배려에 감격할지는 모르겠지만...","source_cn":"那么，无论有没有被吵醒，是恨得牙痒痒，还是对我的关怀感...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568A8C2FEAA4EB2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1360243012:1":{"text":"이 순간을 만끽하도록 하세요!","source_cn":"都享受这片刻的时光吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDB4A8A520BA82B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贝利尔":{"text":"베릴","source":"贝利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":1}}